# Phosphor icons kept in the bundle (`pnpm phosphor --subset`). Icons in
# Webflow markup and C | Button's Icon prop aren't in src/, so they are
# listed here: every icon the approved prototype uses, plus a few an editor
# is likely to pick. An icon not listed draws nothing until it is added here
# and `pnpm phosphor --subset` and `pnpm build` are run again.

# Used by the design
arrow-right
arrow-left
arrow-up-right
arrow-down
plus
minus
x
x-circle
check-circle
brackets-square
magnifying-glass
share-fat
caret-right
caret-down
warning
star
play
house
envelope-simple
cube
list

# Likely editor picks
download-simple
calendar-blank
map-pin
clock
file-text
file-pdf
link-simple
phone
info
user
